Keep a shared people as 0.
Keep a shared width as 0.
Keep a shared edges as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared colors as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared queue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared head as 0.
Keep a shared sound as 0.
Set sound to 1.
Set people to 4.
Set width to people plus 1.
For every cell from 0 to 24.
Place 0 into edges.

The pairs is a list of 1, 2, 1, 3, 2, and 4.
For every pair from 0 to 2.
The left is item (pair times 2) of pairs.
The right is item (pair times 2 plus 1) of pairs.
Set item (left times width plus right) of edges to 1.
Set item (right times width plus left) of edges to 1.

For every tone from 0 to 4.
Place 0 into colors.

To paint from start (a whole number).
Set head to 0.
Place start into queue.
Repeat while head is at most the last position of queue.
The atspot is head.
The person is item atspot of queue.
Add 1 to head.
For every other from 1 to people.
If item (person times width plus other) of edges is 1 and item other of colors is 0, set item other of colors to 3 minus item person of colors, Place other into queue.
If item (person times width plus other) of edges is 1 and item other of colors is item person of colors, set sound to 0.

Set item 1 of colors to 1.
Paint from 1.
If item 2 of colors is 0, set item 2 of colors to 1, paint from 2.
If item 3 of colors is 0, set item 3 of colors to 1, paint from 3.
If item 4 of colors is 0, set item 4 of colors to 1, paint from 4.
If sound is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
